# {{ N.agent }}.2) Monitoring: Collect Business Feedback

On this page, you'll become {{ bu.title | role }} {{ bu.name }}, ask a business question of the Genie Agent, leave feedback when the answer is wrong, then switch back to {{ ai.name }} to review that feedback in the **Monitor** tab.

