1. Click **Monitor** at the top of the Genie Agent screen.

    {{ shot('04-genie-agent/4-2-06-monitor-tab.png', 'Monitor tab') }}

2. In **Activity digest**, verify **Thumbs down** shows 1. In the list below, find the question **{{ t1.question }}** where **Rating** is **Bad** and **Comment** contains {{ bu.name | poss }} comment, then click it.

    {{ shot('04-genie-agent/4-2-07-feedback-list.png', 'Question with feedback') }}

3. In the panel that opens on the right, you can see the user's question, Genie's answer (**Show code** displays the generated SQL), and {{ bu.name | poss }} comment at the bottom.

    {{ shot('04-genie-agent/4-2-08-feedback-detail.png', 'Feedback detail') }}

!!! tip "What Monitoring reveals"
    Monitoring shows how real users phrase their questions and which answers don't satisfy them. From this feedback, you discovered a key problem: **the business term "{{ t1.term }}" is not defined in the Metric View**. We'll fix this problem in {{ N.agent }}.4.

!!! success "Congratulations!"
    You've discovered one problem with the Genie Agent through user feedback. On the next page, you'll find another problem using Benchmark.
